{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117142","id":3363138006,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7IdWnW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117142","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117142.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117142.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117142","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117142/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117142/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117142/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0448fee005f979347c53cacaff8a793b77ccef50","number":117142,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix exposure not working with canvas background on Compatibility.","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes half of #110902.\r\nAlternative to #113863.\r\n\r\nCompatibility applies exposure in the scene shader. Since it's not done in post, this means canvas items do not get affected by it since they don't care about the exposure at all.\r\n\r\nAs a solution, when the exposure is non 1.0 and the background mode is canvas, we can force the internal intermediary buffer to exist and apply exposure to it during the copy operation.\r\n\r\nThis matches the behavior on Forward+/Mobile.\r\n\r\nI tried applying the exposure in the canvas shader instead, but that requires passing down the exposure to the canvas renderer, doing linear/sRGB conversions and also does not work with the background color.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt